   ♥ Bert and Rose Gurney are to be married on Saturday, the 17th of April.
   ⚑ Ada: Bert and Rose Gurney are to be married on Saturday, the 17th of April, and they have no rooms of their own. Rooms in the Buildings are seven or eight shillings a week. Does Ada have them to live with her in her two rooms after the wedding, till they can find rooms of their own? → YES (2:0) She has them to live with her, because she cannot bear to be parted from Bert.
