######## Wednesday, the 24th of March, 1937 (frosty and bright (-2° to 8°C)) ########
   ✉ Ada has a letter from her sister Lizzie, at Paddock Wood in Kent: Her husband has had his wages cut; she asks how Ada is managing.
   ♥ Bert and Rose Gurney are married; they live with Ada.
   ✎ Joan leaves school: a shop girl at a draper's in Upper Street, 10s. 0d. a week.
